ciated with university ranking, such that higher-ranked institutions are more likely to publish papers containing <span  \"><i>\"compulsive\" </i></span> (<span style=\"color: rgba(170, 117, 250, 1.0); font-weight: bold;\">80<sup>th</sup></span> percentile). "}